      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJc8BSOQABBDQR2iKh_GsSYck/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkTmEwVjNiSE5uYTFFMFFUWnhNVTVhU1hNemEzYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡有大約40種不同的咖啡豆可供選擇。我第一杯喝的是坦尚尼亞咖啡豆，感覺不錯，因為我常去其他連鎖咖啡店，所以想換個口味。店裡的環境也很好。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "There are around 40 different coffee beans to choose from. My first cup was Tanzanian beans and it was nice, as I often drink at other chain coffee shops and was looking for something different. The environment was good too.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "TJ Izumi",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108876335991328616856/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPQ_8vrN7IZSAeYjdGvOopPlnvviladQ97al5MzBtOjoQgD8M98A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        "publishTime": "2025-12-06T07:18:31.848684743Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkTmEwVjNiSE5uYTFFMFFUWnhNVTVhU1hNemEzYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkTmEwVjNiSE5uYTFFMFFUWnhNVTVhU1hNemEzYxAB!2m1!1s0x340401003952c073:0xc961126bfca122da"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJc8BSOQABBDQR2iKh_GsSYck/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pobVlXTlVXRlJRTUZKTWNFYzNNVUp3ZW5VNFZFRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "想喝杯悠閒的高品質虹吸咖啡，我總是會選擇這家外帶店。佐敦那家店位置更方便，不過我覺得兩家店都主打食物。食物也很不錯，今天我們還碰巧遇到了在店裡巡邏的龜店長（還有一家正在吃午餐）:)",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Always the \"to go\" one for a chill and quality syphon coffee.  The Jordan one is more convenient in terms of location but I think both shops are food.  Food is also good and today we gotta meet 龜店長 patrol around the shop (and the other oNr having lunch) :)",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
